  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此擴充套件為 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a> 增強了</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/craisinlord/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraisinLord 的</a> 結構中的戰利品：<br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/idas\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合地牢與結構</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合要塞</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合村莊</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合災變</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰利品具有更高的變化性，並從相匹配的原版戰利品表中隨機抽取。該表同時包含模組戰利品，以確保與所有新增戰利品的模組相容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅伺服器端需要安裝，無需客戶端同時安裝所有相關模組。</span><br><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前已知無不相容問題，應能與其他任何模組正常運作。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
